title: "f-TRFu: feasible trust-region funnel method for grey-box optimisation"
abstract: "Scripts, problem definitions and reference results that reproduce Chapter 6 of the PhD thesis “Rigorous Trust-Region Algorithms for Surrogate-based Grey-box Optimisation”: f-TRFu and s-TRFi (Pyomo trust-region solver) against the classical c-TRFu and c-TRFi (TRF-Solver), Tables 6.1-6.3 and Figures 6.2-6.3."
